<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρι-άω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
					107
				</span></i>
			, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.14
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπυρίησα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίᾱσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hippiatr.</u>
					100
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					1.35
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπυριησάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				107
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπυριήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Int.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			:—<i>put</i> persons <i>in a vapour-bath</i>, c.
			acc., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Palaeph.
				43
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λάρυγγ᾽ ἥδιστα π. τεμαχίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crobyl.
					8
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>take a vapour-bath</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				12.519e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dupl.
			acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αὐτὴν ὅσον τριήκοντα πυρίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.75
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>foment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἕλκη σαρξὶν ὑείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					15.1.43
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυριῶνται διά τινος οἱ ὀδόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be used for vapour-baths</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύπερος] πρός τι πυριωμένη ἁρμόζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
